| Dashboard: Process Creation Monitor
| Description: Detects suspicious process creation including PowerShell
| MITRE ATT&CK: T1059.001 - PowerShell, T1059 - Command Execution
| Author: Mohamed Fadhih

index=* source="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4688
| timechart count by ComputerName

| SPL Query 2: Suspicious PowerShell detection
index=* source="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4688
| search Process_Command_Line="*bypass*" OR Process_Command_Line="*hidden*" OR Process_Command_Line="*IEX*" OR Process_Command_Line="*DownloadString*"
| table _time ComputerName Account_Name Process_Command_Line
| eval MITRE_TTP="T1059.001 - PowerShell"
| sort - _time

| SPL Query 3: All process creation with command line
index=* source="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4688
| table _time ComputerName Account_Name New_Process_Name Process_Command_Line
| sort - _time
| head 50
